GOBBLE - third-party components and credits
==========================================

GOBBLE's own code is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). It redistributes no model
weights and no third-party binaries: everything below is fetched or installed
separately, by you.

Gemma / EmbeddingGemma-2 - the embedding model GOBBLE runs
----------------------------------------------------------
GOBBLE embeds text, images and audio with EmbeddingGemma-2, a model from
Google DeepMind. The weights it runs are the GGUF conversion plus multimodal
projector ("mmproj") published by ggml-org, executed locally by llama.cpp.

    model             EmbeddingGemma-2                      Google DeepMind
    weights + mmproj  hf.co/ggml-org/embeddinggemma-2-GGUF  GGUF conversion by ggml-org
    runtime           llama.cpp (llama-server --mmproj)      Georgi Gerganov / ggml-org
    licence           Gemma Terms of Use - https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

