Other components GOBBLE uses
----------------------------
    llama.cpp / llama-server   MIT               local embedding server (text, image, audio)
    ggml-org GGUF conversion   Gemma ToU         model weights packaging
    Ollama (optional backend)  MIT               text-only embeddings alternative
    nomic-embed-text           Apache-2.0        baseline model measured in bench/
    Poppler / pdftotext        GPL-2.0           PDF text + page numbers
    FFmpeg                     LGPL-2.1 / GPL    video keyframes, audio segments, ffprobe
    SQLite                     Public domain     the index
    NumPy                      BSD-3-Clause      cosine scoring
    Pillow                     HPND (MIT-like)   image decoding
    Windows.Media.Ocr (WinRT)  Microsoft         OCR fallback for scanned images/PDFs

Nothing in this repository bundles, mirrors or re-hosts those projects; GOBBLE
only calls them.
